1920, 450ms", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_ruledraw", "label": "ruleDraw \u2014 hairline se dibuja desde el centro (scaleX 0\u21921)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_wordstagger", "label": "wordStagger \u2014 palabras aparecen como tinta (stagger 40ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_wordin", "label": "wordIn \u2014 aparici\u00f3n por palabra (solo opacidad)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_faderise", "label": "fadeRise \u2014 entrada por scroll (whileInView, once)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_scalein", "label": "scaleIn \u2014 entrada con escala m\u00ednima 0.94-0.96", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_rowfade", "label": "rowFade \u2014 fila 'Archivo seleccionado' entra/sale (180ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_polaroidspring", "label": "polaroidSpring \u2014 hover spring interrumpible de polaroids", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Springs solo en interacciones interrumpibles; hover sin delay y whileTap 0.99 para que la polaroid responda al instante."}, {"id": "lib_motion_sealstamp", "label": "sealStamp \u2014 el sello se estampa (scale 1.35\u21921, 260ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La rotaci\u00f3n de 8\u00b0 vive en Framer y no en CSS para que la animaci\u00f3n de estampado controle el transform completo."}, {"id": "lib_motion_bubblein", "label": "bubbleIn \u2014 burbuja de chat entra desde su lado (\u00b110px, 200ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_overlayfade", "label": "overlayFade \u2014 overlay del lightbox (200ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_lightboxcard", "label": "lightboxCard \u2014 card del lightbox (260ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_mediaswap", "label": "mediaSwap \u2014 crossfade con blur 6px al navegar el lightbox", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exit 100ms < enter 180ms para que el sistema se sienta r\u00e1pido al responder; el blur \u22646px es la \u00fanica excepci\u00f3n a la regla de solo transform/opacity, usada para fundir estados."}, {"id": "lib_motion_toastpop", "label": "toastPop \u2014 toast 220ms interrumpible (framer retarget-ea)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "lib_motion_collapse", "label": "collapse \u2014 despliegue del reset-panel (240/300ms)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_animation_hooks_reduced_motion", "label": "Reduced motion (MotionConfig reducedMotion=user)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Respeta la preferencia del usuario: quita movimiento pero conserva opacidad; los loops CSS se apagan en globals.css y el count-up se salta con useReducedMotion()."}, {"id": "docs_animation_hooks_hover_gating", "label": "Hover gating (@media hover:hover)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "future.hoverOnlyWhenSupported en Tailwind pone todo hover: tras @media (hover:hover) para evitar estados hover pegados en pantallas t\u00e1ctiles."}, {"id": "docs_animation_hooks_count_up", "label": "Count-up del contador de d\u00edas (0\u2192d\u00edas en 900ms)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo una vez por visita (ref daysCountedUp) \u2014 se descart\u00f3 repetirlo en cada refresh de 30s porque un elemento visto a diario no debe re-animarse; se salta con useReducedMotion()."}, {"id": "docs_animation_hooks_css_loops", "label": "Loops CSS ambientales (floaty, rise, beat, twinkle)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ANIMATION-HOOKS.md", "sourc